==Korean==

===Etymology===
From [[이]] (''i''), "this" + [[것]] (''geot''), "thing"

===Pronoun===
{{ko-pos|pronoun|rv=igeot|hidx=ㅇ}}   {{context|demonstrative}}

# [[this]]

====Usage notes====
이것 (''igeot'') can contract to [[이거]] (''igeo'').  Thus, 이것[[은]] can contract to [[이건]], 이것[[이]] to [[이게]], 이것[[을]] to [[이걸]], and 이것[[으로]] to [[이걸로]].

